    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "children": [
        "7. Flour and sugar are in the ratio 5:2. If 350 g of flour is used, how much sugar is needed?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "children": [
        "8. A jacket is reduced from £60 to £45. What percentage reduction is this?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "children": [
        "9. The angles in a triangle are 48°, 67° and x°. Find x."
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "children": [
        "10. A rectangle is 8 cm by 5 cm. Find its area and perimeter."
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "children": [
        "11. A bag contains 3 red, 5 blue and 2 green counters. A counter is chosen at random. What is the probability of choosing green?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "attrs": {},
      "children": [
